f_res
```

## Pearson Correlation: Support Index vs Morale Index

```{r corr-test}
cor_res <- cor.test(data$Support_Index, data$Morale_Index, method = "pearson")
cor_res
```

r = `r round(cor_res$estimate, 4)`, p = `r format.pval(cor_res$p.value)`.

